{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI CEO薩姆·奧爾特曼在社交平台X回應近期的內存言論爭議，稱其有關個人電腦內存利用率的表態遭到斷章取義。他強調，自己希望全球擁有充足的內存，也支持用户根據需要為個人電腦配置內存，並再次呼籲擴大內存產能。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585022.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:06:32.086794+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:57:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T12:58:54.365324+00:00","content_hash":"111d9058d2a45dc7e65cf1d91244674a5ed400f95228d50b1647f8914f65593e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}